# TXPPS VST CODE LAB — owner QA passphrase verifier (build-time, optional).
#
# Set this to the SALTED SHA-256 *verifier hash* of your chosen owner passphrase
# (never the passphrase itself), then rebuild:
#
#   TXPPS_QA_PASSPHRASE_HASH=<64-hex-hash> node build.mjs
#
# Compute the verifier from a passphrase (the passphrase stays on your machine,
# only the hash is printed — see tools/qa-hash.mjs):
#
#   node tools/qa-hash.mjs "your-new-owner-passphrase"
#
# If this variable is unset, the build keeps the centralized fallback verifier
# baked into src/js/qa_access.js. Only a verifier hash ever ships — never a
# usable secret. Copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill it in locally.
TXPPS_QA_PASSPHRASE_HASH=replace-with-64-hex-sha256-verifier
